    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was originally known as Nichols Bridge when the first wooden dam and gristmill were built in 1802.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carolina%2C_Rhode_Island"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Carolina was once the site of one of the first trout farms in America, established in 1877.",
