      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carolina%2C_Rhode_Island"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Carolina Village Historic District was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1974.",
